%N A399219 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} (-1)^(k+1) * AO(k)/k^2, where AO(k) = A007509(k)/A352395(k) is the k-th alternating odd harmonic number (or skew-harmonic number of the second kind).
%H A399219 Chunli Li and Wenchang Chu, <a href="https://doi.org/10.3390/math12040589">Evaluating infinite series involving harmonic numbers by integration</a>, Mathematics, Vol. 12, No. 4 (2024), Article 589. See Theorem 8, p. 16.
%H A399219 <a href="/index/Ha#harmonic">Index entries for sequences related to harmonic numbers</a>.
%F A399219 Equals 4*G*log(2) - Pi*W/2, where G is Catalan's constant (A006752), and W = A399217.
%e A399219 0.909191340799229147532316015769167267346204862597638...
%t A399219 RealDigits[4*Catalan*Log[2] - HypergeometricPFQ[{1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2}, {1, 3/2, 3/2}, 1] * Pi/2, 10, 120][[1]]
%o A399219 (PARI) 4*Catalan*log(2) - hypergeom([1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2], [1,3/2,3/2], 1) * Pi/2
